  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDH landscapes program in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NICFI extension in Ethiopia will employ a market-led approach that supports the inclusion of local SMEs and smallholder farmers in the selected value chains with the aim of increasing productivity and incomes of smallholder farmers, ensuring the economic sustainability of SMEs and food security for the growing populations of Ethiopia, and to strengthen climate resilient food production in the selected landscapes.</narrative>
  </description>
